        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mike Bryan, Ray Ruffels, Bob Bryan, Vera Zvonareva, Andy Ram\n- Events: 2004 US Open, 2006 Wimbledon Championships, 2007 Hamburg Masters\n- Roles: professional tennis players, coach\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Ruffels was born on 23 March 1946 in Sydney and is an Australian former professional tennis player and coach.\n- Mike Bryan was born on April 29, 1978 and is an American professional tennis player.\n- Vera Zvonareva won a mixed doubles title at the 2004 US Open with Bob Bryan as her partner.\n- Vera Zvonareva won a mixed doubles title at the 2006 Wimbledon Championships with Andy Ram as her partner.\n- Bob Bryan and Mike Bryan won the doubles title at the 2007 Hamburg Masters.",
